Code systems
------------

The sample requests, rules and responses use a small number of code values only
to show how prior authorization requests are adjudicated. The adjudication rules
are synthetic test rules, not coverage policy.

- HCPCS and ICD-10-CM codes are published by the Centers for Medicare &
  Medicaid Services and the National Center for Health Statistics.
- X12 code values (for example review action codes from code list 306) are
  maintained by X12 and are referenced through the code system URLs defined by
  the Da Vinci PAS Implementation Guide. This project is not affiliated with X12.
- NUBC revenue codes are maintained by the National Uniform Billing Committee,
  and the provider taxonomy codes by the National Uniform Claim Committee.
- This material contains content from LOINC (http://loinc.org). LOINC is
