Conformance testing
-------------------

Conformance was tested with the Inferno Da Vinci PAS Test Kit
(https://github.com/inferno-framework/davinci-pas-test-kit), version 0.15.2,
developed by the Inferno Framework team and licensed under the Apache License,
Version 2.0. The test kit is not included in or redistributed with this
repository. The scripts in harness/ expect a separate local clone of the kit.
The must support metadata in spec/ms-metadata/ lists the element paths the kit
checks, exported so the offline tooling can run without the kit. Passing the
Inferno test suites is not a certification.

Test data
---------

The request Bundles and Inferno inputs in testdata/, the golden exchanges in
spec/examples/ and the fixtures in harness/stubs/ were written for this project
and are generated by testdata/build_testdata.py, spec/reference/pas_reference.py
and harness/stubs/make_fixtures.py. They follow the input formats the Inferno
Da Vinci PAS Test Kit expects but are not copied from it.

All patients, members, subscribers, practitioners, organizations, payers,
identifiers, addresses, phone numbers and email addresses in spec/, testdata/
and harness/ are synthetic. The repository contains no real protected health
information.
